### ===================================
### Word Review API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/review
### ===================================

### Get Review Breakpoint Page Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/getReviewBreakpointPageNumber/1

###

### Create Review Days for Current User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/createTheDays
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Refresh All TTS API Keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/refreshAllApiKey

###

### Get Review Counter by Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/getReviewCounterVO/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get All Review Counters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/getAllReviewCounterVO
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Download Review Audio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/downloadReviewAudio/1/1

###

### Download Character Review Audio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/character/downloadReviewAudio/a

###

### Generate TTS Voice from Paraphrase ID (Deprecated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/generateTtsVoiceFromParaphraseId/1

###

### Increase Review Counter
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/increaseCounter/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Auto Select API Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/autoSelectApiKey

###

### Increase API Key Used Time
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/increaseApiKeyUsedTime/test-api-key

###

### Deprecate API Key for Today
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/deprecateApiKeyToday/test-api-key

###

### Deprecate Review Audio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/deprecate-review-audio/1

###

### Regenerate Review Audio
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/review/reGenReviewAudio/1
